GIBBS FREE ENERGY
-------------------

The Gibbs free energy is G = H - T*S

Total enthalpy                    ...   -553.05275851 Eh 
Total entropy correction          ...     -0.03495413 Eh    -21.93 kcal/mol
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Final Gibbs free energy         ...   -553.08771264 Eh

For completeness - the Gibbs free energy minus the electronic energy
G-E(el)                           ...      0.05032265 Eh     31.58 kcal/mol


